# Class: obo:UBERON_8930101 (mesocolic taenia coli)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "ISBN:978-1496398949") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:29218384") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:30324463") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://purl.org/ccf/ASCTB-TEMP_mesocolic-coli") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:UBERON_8930101 "An organ component layer composed primarily of smooth muscle that forms one of the three longitudinal ribbons (taeniae) of the colon musculature, present on the posteromedial surface of the cecum, ascending colon, descending colon, and sigmoid colon, and positioned posteriorly on the transverse colon at the site of attachment of the transverse mesocolon.")
